WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.580
Gotansha Publishing

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.960
Weekly JIDAI Editorial Department

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.550
Good morning!

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.960
Senpai, you stayed here all night again?

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:21.840
Good morning...

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.550
Did you hear?

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.040
Fumiya and his cameraman were reported
to the police during another stakeout.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.340
Again?

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.000
So, where is he now?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.210
Well... I'm trying his phone right now,
but he isn't picking up.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.960
Weekly JIDAI's photojournalism division,
also known as the "Stakeout Squad."

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.170
I...

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:57.130
What I really wanted to be was a sailor!

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.460
Fumiya Sugawara, 32 years old.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.170
Currently in his ninth year
of photographing people's weaknesses.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:06.920
He's tired of it.

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:29.960
A man who can work, that's the type she likes

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.250
I psyched myself up and got down to business

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.830
But I'm always so busy and so bored

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:41.500
The company I work at now is pretty high level

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.670
And my dad has a lot of connections there

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.830
So there's no way I can quit

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:06.250
I'm always all by myself

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:11.420
I just take a bath and fall asleep

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:16.840
I can't even take the time to admire

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:23.290
Your hair or the way you walk

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:28.590
If all I can do is sleep

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:34.880
Then at least in my dreams

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.880
I want to see you

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:43.920
Stakeout Man

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.210
"Stakeout Man."

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.250
Looks good to me.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.580
Huh? You don't seem satisfied.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.790
In the end, I wasn't able to get details
from anyone within the actual company.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:58.880
It's all just testimony from people
who are loosely related...

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.630
Well, I'll accept it as-is for now.

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:04.800
Personally, I think it's very well-written.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.000
Oh, looks like he's finally made it back.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.340
Hey, make sure to answer your phone!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:20.340
I heard you had the cops called on you again?

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.340
Yeah, we did.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:26.000
A team of two grungy guys
will always end up looking suspicious.

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:28.380
Hey, listen...

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:32.460
How about next time you don't make it a
sausage party and bring one of our ladies with you?

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.460
We have four women in our department
who are more than capable.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.420
But we can't ask Kaji-san
to put up with a job like this.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.800
She already left for the day anyway.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.170
And Yumi-chan is on a business trip to Miyazaki.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.300
Then how about Mayu?

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:48.670
Ah, she's no good.
She'd fall asleep when it got late.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.460
Which means the only one left is...

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:53.550
How about that lady with the natto roll
jammed in her mouth?

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.500
Matsukata.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.130
Tag along with Sugawara
for the rest of today on his stakeout.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.540
You've finished your article already.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:07.540
And you're free tonight, yeah?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:10.870
No... I... have a date today.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:12.670
It's fine.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.710
I have no problem handling it on my own.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.050
I don't need any sympathy.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.580
Oh, okay.

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:28.500
Office Kitchen

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.050
Jeez!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.710
Why does that guy always act
like women are his mortal enemies?

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.420
I'm not sure...

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.130
I didn't want to go on a stakeout anyway.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.120
Right now I need tea, so-

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.880
That's right! Nobody wants to do that job
even if you beg them!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:46.010
And yet when they talked about needing a woman
on the team, I tried to help out, but...

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:49.500
Ultimately you're just going to get in the way,
so don't worry about it.

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:52.590
That attitude pissed me off so much!

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.050
You said so yourself, Senpai!

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:57.620
Gossip articles like those are the absolute worst!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:01.170
How much fun can it be to wait and catch people
in a moment of weakness, anyway?!

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.750
I don't think anyone finds it fun.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.630
Huh?

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:09.910
At the very least, when I look at Sugawara-san,
he never seems to enjoy his job.

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:13.630
Meeting in Progress

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:13.550
I'm used to dealing with hate.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.330
That's just part of the job.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.250
An "athletic affair," eh?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.710
It sounds promising to me.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.010
This involves that one young female sprinter, right?

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.170
Sasamoto? What was her name?

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.050
It's Sasaki.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.210
Kazuyo Sasaki, 20 years old.

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.460
Her coach is pretty famous too, right?

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.590
This guy with the sideburns,
Yamamoto or whatever his name was.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:40.500
Sasaki has been touted all over the media recently
as being a medal contender in the next Olympics.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.620
But her coach, Yamamoto,
seems to have a bad habit...

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:46.920
At each Olympics, he's had an affair
with one of the athletes.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:51.410
And as a result, he's gotten divorced
and remarried multiple times.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:54.290
If it happens again, it'll be the third time.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:01.080
Every day after training, the two of them leave
to go get massages in Shibuya at...

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.250
This is east... in East Shibuya.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.910
They both visit the same sports massage therapist
in a shady part of town.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.580
Then afterwards they take a car
all the way to Sasaki's apartment.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.960
Okay, I get your point.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.620
I definitely think our readers will eat it up.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:20.210
But generally speaking, nobody is surprised
when a coach and athlete get together.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.580
For now, let's just get the pictures.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:24.580
You have to catch them in the act.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.670
That's your job, get to it.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:34.340
RAMEN BAR DAIKICHI

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:36.800
Huh? The Stakeout Squad?

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.920
I'd never want to work there.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:43.750
I mean, the job they do is gross, scary, and difficult.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:55.250
Akihisa Kobayashi (29)
Editor in Charge of Smut

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:47.290
Not to mention their senior editor
has no interest in doing his job.

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:55.170
I heard his dream was originally to be a novelist.

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:04.380
Shinji

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.760
Hello, Hiro?

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.670
Yeah, about tonight...

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:11.750
Ah.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:14.500
Huh? Something wrong? You sound depressed.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:18.290
Huh? Really? Well, today's been rough...

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:19.830
Having trouble at work?

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.210
Yeah...

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:28.000
There's a special article I'm working on, and I know
I can wrap it up if I just talk to one person.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.880
But no matter what I do,
they won't agree to cooperate with me.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.210
I see...

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:35.750
Oh, good work today!

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:39.790
Basically, I had no choice but to write it
using only the information I had on hand.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:43.460
I see. But, you shouldn't
worry about that too much.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:44.460
Huh?

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.920
You did your best with
the limited amount of time you had, right?

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.120
Well of course, but...

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.080
Then I'm sure it's good enough.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:58.460
And you know, your readers don't actually care
that much about whether you got it right or not.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:07:59.960
That's not true!

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:02.170
Uh... sorry!

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:06.340
Ah, no... you actually might be right.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:10.880
But just because that's the case,
I don't want to lower my standards as a writer!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.630
I didn't mean to upset you.

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:16.670
I'm really sorry.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:18.380
M-me too...

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.080
I lost my temper for a second there.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.290
Um... so what did you call about?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:29.300
Oh, right. About our date tonight...
work is going to get in the way again.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.660
Senpai! Narita-san wants...

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.540
Did something happen?

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.080
And my sexless life continues on...

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:42.960
Huh?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:57.210
The sky is beautiful. Up there, all things stay the
same no matter if people appreciate them or not.

00:08:57.790 --> 00:09:02.330
Damn it... I'm having doubts again,
but too many years have passed...

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.290
I should just learn to accept it.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.000
Ah, there you are.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:07.080
Sugawara-san!

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:11.500
I really think we should ask one of the women
to join the stakeout tonight.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.290
Stop making that angry face.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:21.130
You can't do it alone! That massage therapist
moved to a building that's popular with women!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.750
If that's the case, then...

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:25.920
I'll just watch the entrance or the parking lot.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:27.750
They don't have either of those!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:31.010
The first floor is occupied
by a lingerie and accessory shop.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.760
Then I'll stake out the house.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.000
And we just got busted there the other day!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.370
Come on, we're out of options.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.630
So... that's the deal!

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:48.330
Even just for tonight we were hoping
you might be willing to help us out, Matsukata-san.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:52.290
Hey, come on. You need
to ask her too, Sugawara-san.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:55.540
Hiroko Matsukata.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.580
Exactly the type I hate dealing with.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:02.000
Strong-willed, always overly emotional, and selfish.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:06.410
All amplified by the positive feedback
she gets just from being able to do her job.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:10.120
Leaves work in a hurry
when she's got a date with a man.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.050
Bye, everybody~

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.800
Rushes home early when her skin gets dry.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:19.080
No! I'm going to lose my youthful skin!

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.880
This is pointless.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:23.760
She'll just come up with an excuse
like that to avoid the stakeout.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.550
I just know it.

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.540
Okay, I'm in.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.040
See? I knew-

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.040
What?

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:30.710
I'll join the stakeout.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:31.630
Huh?

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:32.750
She agreed?

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.590
That's great, Sugawara-san!

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.250
Uh, yeah...

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.830
Hey, what's up with Matsukata?

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:44.000
For some reason her date got cancelled earlier.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.420
Oh, is that why?

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:48.250
Really? Are we sure her boyfriend isn't imaginary?

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.420
Hey! I can hear you over there!

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.630
My date did get cancelled, but...

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:58.540
Anyone can tell just from his attitude and that stare.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.330
"Women are my enemy."

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:04.380
Or rather, it seems his anger
is directed at me specifically.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.670
This is a good opportunity for me to find out why.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.750
Natto Roll

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:12.800
I can't think of any reason
he could have to hate me...

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:18.540
But I also don't think he's the type
to hate someone without a reason.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.210
I bought the food for our stakeout this evening.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:30.670
Pulling out without saying anything...
I can't imagine how sex with him must be...

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.420
Um, who are we staking out tonight?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.590
An Olympic athlete.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.830
Ah, it must be Sasaki. The sprinter.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:44.370
I knew that coach seemed suspicious.
This means I was right on the money.

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:50.960
There it is... he's always so overbearing...

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.880
There is a reason I never want
to take a woman with me on a stakeout.

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.840
Although they love talking their mouths off
about all kinds of scandals...

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:03.420
I can't believe people just write
those horrible gossip articles!

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:07.590
They hate to be the person
who actually does all the dirty work.

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:12.420
You know, when I first joined the company,
I was put in the Stakeout Squad right away.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.790
I know.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.420
I was there, too.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:21.460
But I told them I didn't like it
and they transferred me right away...

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:25.920
Thank you. As of today I've been transferred
to the political division.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:29.550
I wasn't here for long,
but I appreciated working with all of you.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:33.250
And that's precisely why I hate you.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:37.170
Ever since then, there's one thing
that I've always been curious about.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:41.420
Back then I was often put in charge
of developing your film, Sugawara-san.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:43.590
Why the fascination with... the sky?

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:48.910
At the beginning and end of every one
of your film rolls, there were pictures of the sky.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.920
Who said you could look at my film?!

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:54.800
Moreover, can't you tell
that's something personal and private?!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.660
Maybe you did it because...

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:00.120
...it's your good luck charm or something?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.210
Okay, I've had it.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.670
I'm not talking to her at all,
unless it's something work related.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:06.960
Pure silence!

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:09.210
Is this the place?

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:13.460
The third floor of that orange building.
The second window from the right.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:14.500
Okay.

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:19.130
We need shots of them arriving together,
and then Coach Yamamoto leaving afterwards.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.920
We have to get both pictures for this to work.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:22.880
Understood.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:26.790
Did she already forget about
the question she asked me earlier?

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:30.130
I wouldn't answer even
if she brought it up again, anyway.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.170
Still nothing...

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.840
It's only been 10 minutes.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.000
Another natto roll?

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:47.380
The Stakeout Squad... sure is rough.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.050
I suppose.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.620
Too many idiots who only want to quit,
so it causes a lot of trouble.

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:53.380
And you won't quit, Sugawara-san?

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.800
That was aimed at you, damn it.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:00.750
If everybody quit like that,
who would be left to get the job done?

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:03.170
Wouldn't someone just fill in?

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.760
Ah, someone's coming.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:06.330
What?

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:10.920
It's the lady who called the cops on us yesterday.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:15.540
Even though we're in a different car...
Damn it, nosy old maid.

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.960
H-hey! What are you doing?!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.910
Shh. Be quiet.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:29.710
Huh?

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.460
Let's make it look like we're lovers.

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:33.920
W-wait a second!

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:34.800
Hey!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.460
What is this woman's deal?!

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:42.340
If she sees us like this,
she won't think it's a stakeout.

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:52.130
How obscene, doing it in public!

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:54.590
Did she leave?

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.920
No... she's watching.

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.670
She's right up to the window staring directly at us.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:01.800
Seriously?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.920
Should we get angry and tell her off for snooping?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:08.960
Idiot! If you cause a scene now,
she'll just call the cops again.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.920
Then please play along
to make this more convincing!

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.880
Why should I?

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:15.420
It's for the job!

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:18.330
Y-yeah... the job...

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:22.380
If it's for work... I'll put up with anything.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:25.460
I've been wanting to ask you this, but...

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.460
Why do you hate me?

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.420
What did I ever do to you?

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:33.370
Is it because... I quit the Stakeout Squad?

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.330
Damn it...

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:39.960
She seriously gets on my nerves,
never holding back on anything.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.120
She has absolutely no tact.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.500
She's finally gone.

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:47.580
Ah!

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.000
Tissue! Tissue!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.380
There's none! Then a handkerchief! Handkerchief!

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:55.300
Quit freaking out!

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:56.580
Take off your shirt!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.210
Huh?

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:58.630
I'll go wash it in the park over there!

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:00.300
J-just leave it! Idiot!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.370
What are you saying?!

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.800
If it doesn't get cleaned now, it'll leave a stain!

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:09.160
I can't believe this, who does she think she is?

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:13.800
But... what is it about her
that makes me feel this way?

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:16.920
I feel something stronger than hate.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.510
Am I really that bothered
that she quit the Stakeout Squad?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:25.040
I wasn't here for long,
but I appreciated working with all of you.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:31.710
The old editor-in-chief always used to say,
"This is a job someone has to do."

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:37.040
That's right... a job people don't appreciate,
but need someone to do.

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:39.800
Wouldn't someone just fill in?

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:42.710
She made it sound so simple.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:47.170
I can't forgive that. She'll never understand.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:52.050
If there's something bothering you
then just come out and say it!

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:54.710
Huh?

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.330
That taxi, could it be...?

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:11.550
That's them.

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:35.670
Now.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:49.800
Sugawara-san!

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:50.540
Is that them?

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.290
I know. Don't shout.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.960
You can't use those shots!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:56.960
I'm telling you, I know that already!

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:00.830
I took some shots, but I won't use them.

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.960
They only show that he dropped her off, anyway.

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:07.210
Okay, I see. I'm sorry I overreacted.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.580
How did she know that?

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:14.960
She knew that wasn't the right moment to shoot...

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:26.050
I'm a writer, so if I hear a rumor
or whispers on the street, then...

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:29.870
of course, I always try to turn it into an article...

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:31.340
But...

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.880
But I don't want the Stakeout Squad
to produce work like that.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:37.790
That goes without saying!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:38.840
Wha-?

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:42.960
Pictures convey the absolute truth,
so even just one has a great amount of influence!

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:45.540
Wh-why are you shouting?

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:50.420
But unless it's a picture that can convince readers
with just one look then there's no point in taking it!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:51.870
Don't pretend we do any less!

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.420
That's why I apologized for overreacting!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.210
Don't get so worked up over it!

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:00.750
That's it... that's why she gets
on my nerves so much.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:04.000
It's because she understands everything.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:08.830
Damn... she annoys me to no end.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:12.840
This sucks.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:26.620
There was no particular reason

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:26.630
The sky is beautiful in the morning.

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:33.210
I just mindlessly wiped away my tears

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:31.380
Even today, it's enough to make
a woman like her look radiant.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:40.670
Words like "I don't believe" or "It doesn't matter what you do"

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:45.340
Up until now, we've both hurt each other with them

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.000
I realize how stupid this all is.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:53.370
But if this is how it ends, we should've been more fearless

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.710
And I realize how insignificant I am in the end.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:59.250
We should have spent all that time laughing

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:02.330
Together, the two of us

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:05.250
This isn't a job I can feel proud of or boast about.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:08.130
When this swaying train starts moving,

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:11.170
I hear from beyond the window

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:12.000
To make sure I never forget that...

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:14.460
Oh yeah, that cherished song

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:13.590
And...

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.960
To make sure I don't lose my way.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.500
When morning comes,

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:23.420
I hear from far away in the sky between the clouds

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:19.630
Sorry...

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:22.910
I fell asleep.

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:23.880
Yeah.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.960
Oh yeah, a sweet voice

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:27.960
I guess the stakeout was a failure... in the end.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:28.620
Yeah.

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:32.920
That's our song, baby

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.540
You're taking pictures of the sky again today.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:39.080
Memories ride the night train

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:40.290
So tell me...

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.120
Yes?

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:43.710
Why are you always eating natto rolls?

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:52.670
That's personal.

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:58.540
The type of woman I don't care for?

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:03.590
Fumiya Sugawara (32)
Hobby: Taking pictures of the sky and clouds

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:01.540
Women that speak bluntly
without any reservation, I'd say.

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:06.040
Selfish and overbearing...

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:08.750
Currently searching for girlfriend or wife

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:08.920
Openly clinging to men all the time...

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.130
Oh and also...

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:14.790
If they eat natto rolls, that's the absolute worst.

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:20.580
Natto Roll
The fermented soybeans inside are rich in isoflavones
which increase estrogenic hormonal activity.

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:32.550
Shangri-la

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:37.750
Even in my dreams you can't manage a proper smile

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:43.080
I just want to chide and love a hopeless person like you

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:50.080
Today I thought about you and now I can't sleep

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:53.660
Where shall we go?

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:59.130
Ahh... ahh...

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.380
Shangri-la

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:06.340
Let me hear you shout "I'm happy!"

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:10.620
Let me see the tears underneath your tough exterior

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:12.300
Shangri-la

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:17.250
Today I thought about you and now I can't sleep

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:22.290
Please chide and love a hopeless person like me

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:25.540
Shinji
Nice Work Today
Do your best, but don't
wear yourself out.
-Shinji

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:35.830
Next Episode: Ramen Man
